 "remarks": "***LANDLORD COVERS ALL UTILITIES*** Elegant Georgian Colonial Rental in North Stamford - This stunning all-brick home offers 4-5 bedrooms, 4.5 baths, soaring ceilings, hardwood floors throughout, four fireplaces, and exquisite custom millwork. Enjoy a designer granite kitchen with center island, a dramatic family room with 16' ceilings, an oak library, and spacious king-sized bedrooms. The finished lower level features a wine cellar, gym, office, and recreation room. Privately set behind a gated entrance and bordering conservation land, this exceptional rental combines luxury, space, and tranquility in one of Stamford's most desirable locations. Here's a polished version you can use in your listing: **Important Addendum:** This property includes a private wing that is **not** included in this rental. The owner intends to occupy the in-law suite, which is located in a separate wing of the home with its own private space, allowing for privacy and independence for both parties. Please ensure you understand and are comfortable with this arrangement before scheduling a tour.",
